Experimental Results

Dataset: Cloud Computing and Serverless Architecture
Pages: 8
Chunks: 25
Questions: 20
Evaluation cutoff: Top-5 retrieval
Embedding model: all-MiniLM-L6-v2
RRF constant: 60
Cross-Encoder: cross-encoder/ms-marco-MiniLM-L-6-v2

Method	Precision@5	Recall@5	MRR	NDCG@5
Dense Retrieval	0.3000	0.9417	0.9750	0.9167
BM25	0.2500	0.8167	0.7375	0.7058
Hybrid + RRF	0.2800	0.8917	0.9250	0.8610
Hybrid + Cross-Encoder	0.2900	0.9167	0.9625	0.8983

Observation
Dense Retrieval achieved the highest scores across all four evaluated retrieval metrics on the selected dataset. 
Hybrid Retrieval improved over BM25, while Cross-Encoder reranking further improved the Hybrid approach. However,
neither Hybrid nor reranking exceeded Dense Retrieval on this evaluation set.